---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import { site } from '../data/site';
---
<Base title="Privacy" description="How Toteally Sisters handles the information you share with us.">
  <section class="section">
    <div class="wrap prose legal">
      <h1>Privacy</h1>
      <p class="lede">The short version: what you tell us stays with the small team that runs Toteally Sisters. We use it to welcome you and invite you to meetups. We never sell it.</p>
      <p class="updated">Last updated November 2026</p>

      <h2>What we collect</h2>
      <p>When you fill out the Join form, we receive what you choose to share: your name, email, and optionally your phone number, city and state, whether you’re a survivor, in treatment or a caregiver, your type of cancer, what you’re hoping for, how you heard about us, and anything else you write.</p>
      <p>Only your name and email are required. Everything about your health is optional. Share only what you’re comfortable with.</p>

      <h2>How we use it</h2>
      <ul>
        <li>To email you a welcome and the link to our monthly Zoom meetup.</li>
        <li>To understand who our community is, so we can plan meetups and events that help.</li>
        <li>To let you know about upcoming gatherings. You can ask us to stop at any time.</li>
      </ul>

      <h2>Who sees it</h2>
      <p>Your form is emailed to the Toteally Sisters team member who welcomes new members. We don’t share it with sponsors, partners, OCRA or anyone else, and we don’t sell or rent it.</p>
      <p>Your submission passes through a service that delivers the email to us. That service handles it only to deliver it.</p>

      <h2>What this site doesn’t do</h2>
      <p>This website doesn’t use advertising trackers. Our hosting provider may keep standard server logs, such as IP addresses, for security.</p>

      <h2>Donations</h2>
      <p>Donate links take you to the Ovarian Cancer Research Alliance’s site. Payments and the information you give there are handled by OCRA under its own privacy policy.</p>

      <h2>Your choices</h2>
      <p>You can ask us to see, correct or delete what you’ve shared at any time. Message us on <a href={site.instagram} rel="noopener">Instagram</a> or <a href={site.facebook} rel="noopener">Facebook</a>, or reply to any email we’ve sent you.</p>

      <h2>Not medical advice</h2>
      <p>Toteally Sisters is peer support from women who’ve been there. Nothing on this site or in our meetups is medical advice. Please talk with your care team about your health.</p>
    </div>
  </section>
</Base>

<style>
  .legal h1 { font-size: var(--step-3); }
  .updated { color: var(--ink-soft); font-size: var(--step--1); }
  .legal ul { padding-left: 1.2rem; display: grid; gap: 0.5rem; }
</style>
